# Architecture Rules

- Keep FastAPI route handlers thin; business logic belongs in `app/ai/`.
- AI-specific logic (prompting, generation, orchestration) lives under `app/ai/`.
- MCP server code lives under `app/mcp/` and should not import from `app/main.py`.
- Prefer dependency injection over global state for configuration and clients.
